    "output": "1. This screen wants me to read what my monthly house payment would be, and then tell it I'm finished.\n\n2. I would tap \"I'm done\".\n\n3. Words and phrases I did not understand or that felt like tech talk:\n- \"Loan payment only. Tax and insurance are not in it yet.\" I don't know what \"not in it yet\" means. Will they be added later? By whom?\n- \"Loan amount.\" I can guess it, but it isn't the price of the house, and that confused me for a second.\n- \"6.5 %\" with a space before the percent sign looks odd. I don't know whether that rate is good or bad.\n- \"Step 5 of 5: your answer.\" Fine, but \"answer\" sounds like a test.\n- \"More options.\" I have no idea what options.\n- \"See all the numbers.\" Which numbers?\n- \"Lender statement.\" I think it's the paper from the bank, but I'm not sure.\n- \"Estimate.\" I understand it, but it makes me wonder how far off it could be.\n\n4. Things that made me worry:\n- \"Tax and insurance are not in it yet.\" I worry my real payment is much higher than $1,516.96 and I'd be caught off guard.\n- \"Print or save.\" I wonder where it saves and whether my numbers go somewhere.\n- \"I'm done.\" I worry that I'd lose my answer, or that it counts as agreeing to something or sends my numbers to someone.\n- \"Change my numbers.\" I'm not sure whether it erases everything and starts over.\n- \"More options\" is closed and vague, and I don't know whether it leads to something I'd have to pay for or sign up for.\n\n5. What I would skip:\n- \"More options,\" because I can't tell what it does for me.\n- \"See all the numbers,\" because I already have the one number I came for.\n- \"What the words mean\" is something I might open once, but I wouldn't start with it.\n- The last line, \"This is an estimate. Your lender statement has the final numbers.\" It repeats the idea in \"That is your estimate.\"\n\n6. Score: 4. I'm fairly sure I should tap \"I'm done\" because it's the orange one and the screen says \"You can stop here,\" but I'm unsure what happens after that.\n\nRESULT: {\"next_tap\":\"I'm done\",\"confusing_terms\":[\"not in it yet (tax and insurance)\",\"Loan amount\",\"6.5 %\",\"More options\",\"See all the numbers\",\"lender statement\",\"estimate\"],\"worries\":[\"real payment may be much higher once tax and insurance are added\",\"does 'I'm done' lose my answer or send my numbers somewhere\",\"where does 'Print or save' save to\",\"does 'Change my numbers' erase everything\",\"'More options' might lead to something with a cost\"],\"skippable\":[\"More options\",\"See all the numbers\",\"final line repeating that it is an estimate\"],\"score\":4}"
